  "contentHtml": "<p>스타쉽 착륙영상을 역재생 시켰습니다.</p><p>앞 부분에 역재생 시킨 영상을 학생들에게ㅔ 보여주고</p><p>우주선이 발사되는 장면인데 이상한 점을 찾아 보라고 했습니다.</p><p>처음에는 발사장면으로 알고 있다가, 하나 둘 이상한 점을 찾아내고</p><p>결국 착륙하는 영상이라는 것을 추리해 내네요.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv1qejbh04ukholetnjj1vioi@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rv1qejbh04ukholetnjj1vioi/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33286486331&amp;signature=yKWwBhDHL1%2Fih2kZHTAspQYLrXE%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv1qejbh04ukholetnjj1vioi?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2MXFlamJoMDR1a2hvbGV0bmpqMXZpb2kiLCJ0aWQiOiIzNzljODFmNy0yZjg4LTRiNTItYmMwNi0xYWJmMDliZGYwZTMiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODk1MDR9.WDtkAFVMwwdmbZ_vmXQLJbYLV7oDDUsHY7q2Py8rUqaaQ1dRUTmc-5cSaNx0BCm0kaA--XjlndeB0FsCfUGdSQ&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
